    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is the Last Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short narrative game with a dark and heavy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Jon\u2019s final day at work\u2014just before heading home\u2026 or so he thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554430/extras/cd757d09a3073186f38ee085cb9325ab.avif?t=1744196473\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music and Sound design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With carefully selected and arranged audio, every detail serves a purpose. Listen closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 Music by NicoTeenLow\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A brief story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple yet immersive experience, lasting no more than 5\u201310 minutes. The gameplay is minimal, but the atmosphere lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554430/extras/16e4a9bf2b0957ba34d886a651b7ff7f.avif?t=1744196473\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and simple narrative exerience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and heavy atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist graphics with hand crafted 3D assets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is the Last Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short narrative game with a dark and heavy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Jon\u2019s final day at work\u2014just before heading home\u2026 or so he thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554430/extras/cd757d09a3073186f38ee085cb9325ab.avif?t=1744196473\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music and Sound design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With carefully selected and arranged audio, every detail serves a purpose. Listen closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 Music by NicoTeenLow\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A brief story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple yet immersive experience, lasting no more than 5\u201310 minutes. The gameplay is minimal, but the atmosphere lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554430/extras/16e4a9bf2b0957ba34d886a651b7ff7f.avif?t=1744196473\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and simple narrative exerience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and heavy atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist graphics with hand crafted 3D assets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
